      "authority_id": "plan-immutability",
      "subject": "Freezing the current desired state into an immutable plan and its SHA-256 digest, and refusing approval evidence whose content digest is not that digest. Changing the plan makes a prior approval stale rather than transferable, which is the whole of the binding.",
